'''Clemont’s Backpack''' (Japanese: '''シトロンのリュック''' ''Citron’s Backpack'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=During this turn, attacks used by your {{TCGP|Magneton}} or {{TCGP|Heliolisk}} do +20 damage to your opponent's Pokémon.
}}

==Trivia==
===Origin===
* This card depicts the [[bag]] used by [[Clemont]] in the games and animated series, often referred to as [[Clemontic Gear]].

